    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Krispy Kreme was going to put glazed doughnuts in every McDonald's in America.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.03,
        "window": 3.67,
        "fill": 0.826
      },
      {
        "scene": "deal",
        "text": "Then they broke up. The deal, announced in March, was to reach all 13,500 of them, with fresh boxes every morning.",
        "start": 3.97,
        "seconds": 5.51,
        "window": 6.17,
        "fill": 0.893
      },
      {
        "scene": "abroad",
        "text": "Krispy Kreme sells in more than 40 countries, like this motorway stop in England.",
        "start": 10.13,
        "seconds": 3.46,
        "window": 4.1,
        "fill": 0.844
      },
      {
        "scene": "trucks",
        "text": "Trucks drove the boxes out from Krispy Kreme's own kitchens, restaurant after restaurant. But who paid for all those trips?",
        "start": 14.23,
        "seconds": 5.17,
        "window": 5.87,
        "fill": 0.881
      },
      {
        "scene": "why",
        "text": "So why would anyone walk away from McDonald's?",
        "start": 20.1,
        "seconds": 1.76,
        "window": 2.47,
        "fill": 0.713
      },
      {
        "scene": "costs",
        "text": "Krispy Kreme said it could not get its costs in line with how many doughnuts sold.",
        "start": 22.57,
        "seconds": 3.08,
        "window": 3.73,
        "fill": 0.826
      },
      {
        "scene": "shares",
        "text": "By then, its shares were down more than 73% so far that year.",
        "start": 26.3,
        "seconds": 3.07,
        "window": 3.7,
        "fill": 0.83
      },
      {
        "scene": "over",
        "text": "So the two companies called it off, and in July the deal was over.",
        "start": 30.0,
        "seconds": 2.65,
        "window": 3.33,
        "fill": 0.796
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "When it ended, Krispy Kreme was in only about 2,400 of those McDonald's.",
        "start": 33.33,
        "seconds": 3.59,
        "window": 4.27,
        "fill": 0.841
      },
      {
        "scene": "ending",
        "text": "Glazed doughnut or McFlurry: which would you order at the counter? Remember,",
